{"4269100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "What'Sub", "steam_appid": 4269100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What'Sub</strong> is a 1–4 player co-op extraction diver where you crew a rust-bucket submarine, descend into the Bermuda Triangle, and decide how deep your greed actually goes.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Descend into &quot;The Well&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate caverns, wrecks, and treacherous terrain. Visibility is limited. Hazards appear late. The deeper you go, the more long-lost treasure waits and the harder it gets to leave.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269100/extras/132cf1077cd696f4bf3b298f24af8c04.poster.avif?t=1779725663\" width=750 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269100/extras/132cf1077cd696f4bf3b298f24af8c04.webm?t=1779725663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269100/extras/132cf1077cd696f4bf3b298f24af8c04.mp4?t=1779725663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Risk It or Lose It</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it back to the surface with your haul and keep everything: loot, upgrades, progress. Drown down there and lose everything you brought in. Every dive is a negotiation between what you stand to gain and what you're willing to gamble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269100/extras/49f2e5ab3f29a61da0bc5df9764804ef.poster.avif?t=1779725663\" width=750 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269100/extras/49f2e5ab3f29a61da0bc5df9764804ef.webm?t=1779725663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269100/extras/49f2e5ab3f29a61da0bc5df9764804ef.mp4?t=1779725663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep the Sub Running</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sub breaks down constantly, at the worst possible moment, for the least forgivable reason. Hull breaches, a stalled engine; the list of things that can go wrong is longer than the list of things working correctly. Patch it, smack it, restart it, and keep moving. It's not much, but it's all you've got.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269100/extras/7f1b9198d06bb4d169e77c095c2ad6be.poster.avif?t=1779725663\" width=750 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269100/extras/7f1b9198d06bb4d169e77c095c2ad6be.webm?t=1779725663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269100/extras/7f1b9198d06bb4d169e77c095c2ad6be.mp4?t=1779725663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Ocean Never Repeats Itself</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels mean no two dives are the same. There's always something new to discover and always a reason to go back down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269100/extras/9656c1c5f24bb5421142561c5d05ac19.poster.avif?t=1779725663\" width=750 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269100/extras/9656c1c5f24bb5421142561c5d05ac19.webm?t=1779725663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269100/extras/9656c1c5f24bb5421142561c5d05ac19.mp4?t=1779725663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strange Faces at the Bottom</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Well has its own residents. Meet the characters that call the deep home, buy cosmetics, and pry secrets about the Well out of the ones willing to talk.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269100/extras/59d872d107f71aaefcf0f29001d0ac65.poster.avif?t=1779725663\" width=750 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269100/extras/59d872d107f71aaefcf0f29001d0ac65.webm?t=1779725663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4269100/extras/59d872d107f71aaefcf0f29001d0ac65.mp4?t=1779725663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Online co-op for up to four players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Extraction mechanics with full loot loss on death</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Interdependent submarine systems and crew roles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Characters, cosmetics, and a customizable submarine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Procedurally generated ocean levels</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What'Sub</strong> is a 1–4 player co-op extraction diver where you crew a rust-bucket submarine, descend into the Bermuda Triangle, and decide how deep your greed actually goes.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Descend into &quot;The Well&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragr